[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚可能是陷入了恐慌状态，<br>于是松开了抓住雪莉肩膀的手。|#0102Bad02_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:紧接着，米莉亚从雪莉的背上滚了下来。|#0102Bad02_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哇！？|#0102Bad02_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，米莉亚！|#0102Bad02_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚！！|#0102Bad02_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜哇啊啊啊啊，要被打中了！<br>要被打死了！！|#0102Bad02_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚一边发出凄惨的喊叫<br>一边逃进树丛里。|#0102Bad02_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，米莉亚！那边不对……！|#0102Bad02_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛！看守往这边过来了！<br>再不走就要被追上了！|#0102Bad02_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:可、可是！|#0102Bad02_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:啧，喂！快跑啊！|#0102Bad02_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised

[PrintTextModified Text:待会再来<br>找米莉亚吧！|#0102Bad02_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在得赶紧逃！|#0102Bad02_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我知道了。|#0102Bad02_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（米莉亚！我一定会回来接你的，<br>　求你不要出事……！）|#0102Bad02_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛依依难舍地<br>离开了这里。|#0102Bad02_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

