[PrintTextModified Text:和艾玛她们走散后，米莉亚逃跑到某个地方，<br>在那里她遇到了异形的怪物——魔女的残骸。|#0102Bad02_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:对、对不起……我不会跑的，<br>求求……求你们放过我……！|#0102Bad02_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:JailerC

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0102Bad02_StrayNarehate002| AuthorId:StrayNarehate RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0102Bad02_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:沉默笼罩在残骸和米莉亚之间。<br>在这无言的间隙，双方一动不动。|#0102Bad02_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但这沉默并没有持续很久，<br>按捺不住的米莉亚提心吊胆地抬起头。|#0102Bad02_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:请、请问……？|#0102Bad02_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:JailerC

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0102Bad02_StrayNarehate003| AuthorId:StrayNarehate RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:你不杀……我吗？|#0102Bad02_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:JailerC

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0102Bad02_StrayNarehate004| AuthorId:StrayNarehate RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:请、请问……？|#0102Bad02_Miria008| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚歪着头问道，<br>残骸也随之往同一个方向歪起头。|#0102Bad02_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……我可以，回去吗？|#0102Bad02_Miria009| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚又往另一边歪头，<br>残骸也照做起来。|#0102Bad02_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:难道……你是在模仿我？|#0102Bad02_Miria010| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚试着再往另一边<br>歪起头。|#0102Bad02_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:紧接着残骸也照葫芦画瓢似的动了起来。|#0102Bad02_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:看来……你还真是在模仿我。|#0102Bad02_Miria011| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……你，不攻击我吗？|#0102Bad02_Miria012| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:JailerC

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0102Bad02_StrayNarehate005| AuthorId:StrayNarehate RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR9,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，呃……那……<br>大叔我就回去了哦……|#0102Bad02_Miria013| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR9,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:不对？监牢在哪边来着。|#0102Bad02_Miria014| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:或许是因为之前跑得太忘我了，<br>她完全搞不清楚自己现在的方位。|#0102Bad02_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR9,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:请、请问～……<br>可以告诉我监牢在哪里吗……|#0102Bad02_Miria015| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:JailerC
[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚偷瞄了一眼残骸，<br>刚才一动不动的残骸开始静静地移动起来。|#0102Bad02_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0102Bad02_StrayNarehate006| AuthorId:StrayNarehate RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:往前走了一会，它停下脚步<br>像是在等候米莉亚。|#0102Bad02_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……你、你是在……<br>告诉我宅邸的方向吗？|#0102Bad02_Miria016| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:JailerC

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0102Bad02_StrayNarehate007| AuthorId:StrayNarehate RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:它……能听得懂我说话吗？|#0102Bad02_Miria017| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

