[PrintTextModified Text:在残骸的引领下，米莉亚顺利回到监牢里，<br>艾玛和雪莉一见她回来马上跑了过去。|#0102Bad02_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚！你没事吧！|#0102Bad02_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起，刚才没背稳你。<br>你没受伤吧？|#0102Bad02_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:别的不说我身子还挺结实的，没事啦。|#0102Bad02_Miria018| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:倒是雪莉，你没有错不要道歉！<br>错的是慌慌张张的我啦。|#0102Bad02_Miria019| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉，还有艾玛……<br>让你们担心了，真的很抱歉。|#0102Bad02_Miria020| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:别客气啦！|#0102Bad02_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯！只要你没事就好。|#0102Bad02_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:见艾玛和雪莉面露笑容，<br>米莉亚才总算松了口气，微笑起来。|#0102Bad02_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:话说回来，真的好庆幸<br>你没有在森林里迷路。|#0102Bad02_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:就是啊。如果你迷路了<br>很难说能不能在门禁前回来……|#0102Bad02_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，这个嘛……|#0102Bad02_Miria021| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚把刚到嘴边的话吞了回去。|#0102Bad02_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚？你怎么了？|#0102Bad02_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，没事。没什么。|#0102Bad02_Miria022| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR8,ArmL1
[PrintTextModified Text:啊～感觉一放松下来就犯困了。<br>抱歉，大叔我今天先休息了。|#0102Bad02_Miria023| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:是吗，我知道了。<br>晚安，米莉亚。|#0102Bad02_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:晚安。|#0102Bad02_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，晚安。|#0102Bad02_Miria024| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:目送她们离开后，<br>米莉亚长长地吐了口气。|#0102Bad02_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:现在还不确定它是不是安全的，<br>最好别说多余的话吧。|#0102Bad02_Miria025| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明天，我再去见见它好了。|#0102Bad02_Miria026| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

