@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1,ArmR10,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊太好了，还是你。<br>谢谢你昨天带我回监牢。|#0102Bad02_Miria030| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个，不知道算不算得上回礼……<br>总之，请收下。|#0102Bad02_Miria031| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚把食堂拿来的苹果<br>放在两人中间。|#0102Bad02_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR10,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:我不确定你能不能吃，<br>如果可以的话……|#0102Bad02_Miria032| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

