[PrintTextModified Text:接着，它将触手一样的东西飞速伸了过来<br>拿起苹果。|#0102Bad02_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:JailerC

