[PrintTextModified Text:昨天我就在想了，你……应该<br>多少能听懂一点人话吧？|#0102Bad02_Miria034| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:JailerC

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0102Bad02_StrayNarehate011| AuthorId:StrayNarehate RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

