[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚逼到残骸跟前，<br>狠狠抓住它的衣领。|#0102Bad02_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只要跟她沟通，也许她就能理解了！<br>可你竟然……杀了她！！|#0102Bad02_Miria072| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:刚喊出口的下一刻，米莉亚就被<br>残骸紧紧包裹在怀里。|#0102Bad02_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR10,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……？|#0102Bad02_Miria073| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:异形的身体却莫名温暖，<br>米莉亚惊讶地抬头看向它。<br>她的眼睛渐渐热泪盈眶。|#0102Bad02_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:好温暖……|#0102Bad02_Miria074| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你刚才保护了我……<br>我知道的，其实你是个好心的残骸。|#0102Bad02_Miria075| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要是大叔我也像你一样强大该有多好。|#0102Bad02_Miria076| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，为什么你只保护我一个人呢……|#0102Bad02_Miria077| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:就在这拥抱的过程中，<br>米莉亚感到自己的身体开始散发光芒。<br>忽然，她猛然背后一凉。|#0102Bad02_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

