@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_76 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:随后她一下子推开残骸。|#0102Bad02_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Angry1,ArmR10,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:你一开始就知道我的魔法<br>是什么吧……！|#0102Bad02_Miria078| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:所以你为了得到我的肉体……|#0102Bad02_Miria079| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只要双方心意一致触碰彼此，<br>就能交换肉体。|#0102Bad02_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这就是佐伯米莉亚的魔法。|#0102Bad02_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Angry1,ArmR10,ArmL4

